<title>USA: Freeport-McMoRan Oil Nov proceeds, no div.</title>
<headline>Freeport-McMoRan Oil Nov proceeds, no div.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freeport-McMoRan Oil and Gas Royalty Trust said Tuesday that for the month of November 1996, the trust's net proceeds totaled $99,795, or $.00666 per unit, decreasing the cost carry-forward to $2,539,640.</p>
<p>In a release Tuesday, Freeport also said there will be no distribution for November 1996.</p>
<p>The company said net current month trust administrative expenses of $12,340 will be paid from the trust administrative expense reserve.  It said this would result in about $2 million remaining in the expense reserve.</p>
</text>
